{"version":1,"content":"<p>距離英偉達聯合創始人黃仁勳從公司離職還不到一周，要求他回歸的呼聲日益高漲，但英偉達董事會迄今為止拒絕了這一想法。對衝基金大鱷比爾·阿克曼認為，該公司的做法是錯誤的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587034.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.436862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:56:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_hash":"517ec2569afb7da40ea67ed21575616289c0008431b979e11560f70a827e8109","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}